LocalChessEngine
================

LocalChessEngine is a local-first chess engine, NNUE trainer, and Qt Widgets
desktop GUI project. The project-owned C++/Python source, documentation, and
self-authored SVG chess pieces are licensed under the MIT License unless a file
states otherwise.

The command-line engine is distributed as a separate UCI executable. The GUI
launches that engine through a process boundary (`QProcess`) and does not link
Qt into the engine/core targets.

Qt Notice
---------

The `localchessengine_gui` target dynamically links Qt 6 Core, Gui, Widgets,
Svg, and SvgWidgets. The v0.1 distribution uses the LGPLv3 path for Qt dynamic
linking. Qt is also available under other license options from The Qt Company
and the Qt Project.

Redistribution artifacts must include:

- this notice,
- the project MIT license,
- the GNU LGPLv3 and GPLv3 license texts,
- third-party notices and copyright files,
- instructions for replacing or relinking the Qt dynamic libraries, and
- the corresponding Qt/dependency source archive or equivalent source offer.

Privacy Notice
--------------

The product is local-first. The engine and GUI do not send telemetry or game
data by default. Optional FEN-pool export from Hugging Face datasets and
external OpenBench/Cute Chess workflows require explicit user commands.

